NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002505 "200. Third element ($payload) is the actual result, but usually not present when enveloped result is an error response ($status_code is not 2xx). Fourth"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002506 "element (%result_meta) is called result metadata and is optional, a hash"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002507 "that contains extra information, much like how HTTP response headers provide additional metadata."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002508 ""
