NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002626 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002627 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002628 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002629 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002630 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002631 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002632 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002633 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002634 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002635 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002636 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002637 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002638 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002639 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002640 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002641 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002642 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
